member.summary:
Renders many nine-patches into one WriteableBitmap with a single native call.

FULL CANVAS:
  canvas.Resize(totalWidth, totalHeight);
  canvas.RenderBatch(allElements);

VIRTUALISED VIEWPORT (for a ScrollViewer):
  canvas.RenderViewport(allElements, scrollX, scrollY, viewportW, viewportH);
  Only elements that intersect the viewport are rendered, shifted by (-scrollX, -scrollY).
  RenderViewportSorted does the same for lists sorted by Y, using a binary search.

ZOOMED VIEWPORT (see ):
  canvas.Resize(pixelW, pixelH, dpiX, dpiY);
  canvas.RenderViewportScaled(worldElements, sortedByY, offsetX, offsetY, scaleX, scaleY);
  Elements are in world units; each one is mapped to device pixels before it is rendered,
  so the fixed nine-patch borders stay sharp at every zoom level.

The bitmap is premultiplied BGRA (Pbgra32). Bind  to an Image.
